# ${project_name}

${project_description}

Terraform modules consumed by `homelab/tf-live` via SemVer git tags:

```hcl
source = "git::ssh://git@${git_host}/${project_org}/${project_name}.git//modules/<name>?ref=v0.0.0"
```

## Layout

```
modules/<name>/
  main.tf
  variables.tf
  outputs.tf
  versions.tf
  README.md         # regenerated by terraform-docs
```

## Conventions

- One module per directory under `modules/`.
- `terraform-docs` regenerated on every module change (config in
  `.terraform-docs.yml`).
- SemVer tags via `git-cliff`. Bump on every breaking-change PR; consumers
  pin via `?ref=vX.Y.Z`.
- All modules pin provider versions explicitly in `versions.tf`.
